# P12 W4-1 (docs/design/sdk.md 13.1): playing. The simulator's fixed deal
# has the 2 of diamonds on pile 3 and the 3 of spades on pile 4: the
# wheel slides the cursor along the top shelf and on to pile 3 of the
# bottom one, SELECT picks the 2 up (gold ring), one step right, SELECT
# drops it on the 3 and pile 3's next card turns up.
# Then the stock turns three, and the pause menu's Undo takes the draw
# back. Each card placed clicks (the Clicker path).
#   SIM_BUILD=build/sim-ui-mod scripts/shots.sh tests/ui/ipodui-p12-solitaire-moves.script
# needs: modules
# reset: mainmenu

wait 4000
sdk_clear            # a fresh deal (the simulator deals from a fixed seed)
wheel +2             # Extras
wait 600
key SELECT
wait 1200
wheel +4             # Games
wait 600
key SELECT
wait 1200
wheel +5             # Solitaire
wait 600
key SELECT
wait 1500
wheel +8 800         # stock -> pile 3 (along the top shelf, then the tableau)
wait 600
key SELECT           # pick up the 2
wait 500
shot picked
wheel +1 300         # pile 4
wait 500
key SELECT           # drop: 2 on the 3, pile 3 turns a card up
wait 600
shot moved
wheel -9 900         # back to the stock
wait 600
key SELECT           # draw three
wait 600
shot drawn
key MENU             # the pause menu
wait 600
shot menu
wheel +2 400         # Undo
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 800
shot undone
quit
